# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback — this app uses React Router client-side
# routing, so unknown paths (e.g. /clients/abc123 loaded directly, not
# navigated to from within the app) need to fall through to index.html
# rather than 404 from Cloudflare's static file server. Vite copies
# everything in web/public/ into web/dist/ as-is at build time, so this
# lands at the publish directory root where Cloudflare Pages expects it.
# Equivalent to the `routes: [{type: rewrite, source: /*, destination:
# /index.html}]` block in render.yaml for the Render deployment.
